WEBVTT

00:09.050 --> 00:11.050
AozoraSubs and TMUsubs  present

00:11.110 --> 00:15.370
Daa! Daa! Daa!

00:11.420 --> 00:15.370
Mukai awase ni suwatta shunkan ni

00:11.420 --> 00:15.370
The moment we sat facing each other

00:15.800 --> 00:20.080
otona no yokogao ni DOKI DOKI shiteru no

00:15.800 --> 00:20.080
my heart was thumping at the sideways view of your adult-like face

00:20.290 --> 00:24.160
Itsudemo soba ni iru hazu demo

00:20.290 --> 00:24.160
Although you're always beside me

00:24.460 --> 00:28.830
hontou wa KIMI no koto yoku shiranai yo ne

00:24.460 --> 00:28.830
the truth is I don't really know much about you

00:28.840 --> 00:37.510
Itsumo nakamatachi to asonderu kedo

00:28.840 --> 00:37.510
We're always playing with our friends

00:37.510 --> 00:43.180
futarikiri ni naru to doko ka chigau yo

00:37.510 --> 00:43.180
but when we're alone, something's different

00:44.010 --> 00:46.950
Nanika hanashi kakete

00:44.010 --> 00:46.950
Talk to me about anything

00:47.520 --> 00:51.990
Zutto dare yori mo daisuki da yo

00:47.520 --> 00:51.990
I've always loved you more than anyone else

00:51.990 --> 00:56.280
dakedo ienai yo chikasugiru yo

00:51.990 --> 00:56.280
but I can't say it, you're too close

00:56.550 --> 01:00.490
Itsuka kizuite yo mitsumeteru yo

00:56.550 --> 01:00.490
Someday, notice I'm gazing at you

01:00.490 --> 01:04.910
Koi no TANE wo maitara

01:00.490 --> 01:04.910
When we plant the seeds of love

01:04.910 --> 01:09.250
hora sakasou yo ippai

01:04.910 --> 01:09.250
see, a lot of it will bloom

01:09.550 --> 01:15.040
Mou kamisama ni onegai

01:09.550 --> 01:15.040
That's my wish to God

01:22.850 --> 01:25.090
Well then, goodbye.

01:25.960 --> 01:27.750
They've sent quite a lot.

01:27.750 --> 01:29.610
Well, I'll get to work and move them inside.

01:34.530 --> 01:35.830
I did it!

01:35.830 --> 01:38.030
Ruu, guess what this is?

01:38.860 --> 01:40.230
Wannya!

01:40.230 --> 01:41.120
That's right!

01:41.120 --> 01:43.520
I just knew that Ruu has a great eye for things like this!

01:43.520 --> 01:44.930
Pepo!

01:44.930 --> 01:47.450
Oh my, this is a little messy.

01:48.230 --> 01:50.900
I know! I'll make it for you~

01:51.350 --> 01:52.640
Wait, Wannya...

01:52.640 --> 01:53.010
Yes?

01:53.010 --> 01:55.010
What are you doing running back and forth like that?

01:55.330 --> 01:58.470
Yes! I just got some packages by mail order.

01:59.110 --> 02:00.430
Packages?!

02:00.430 --> 02:02.000
Oh my, oh my...

02:02.000 --> 02:05.190
Ruu, Pepo, excuse me for a while- Wannya~!!!

02:05.920 --> 02:07.080
Hurry up and open it!

02:07.080 --> 02:11.590
I love the excitement of opening packages we get in the mail~!

02:11.590 --> 02:13.300
Well, let's hurry up and open them!

02:13.300 --> 02:13.860
Let's do that!

02:14.180 --> 02:15.840
Ruu-chama's milk!

02:16.530 --> 02:17.820
Ruu-chama's nappies!

02:18.130 --> 02:19.740
Ruu-chama's clothes!

02:20.100 --> 02:21.740
My shampoo!

02:22.020 --> 02:23.980
And this is my...

02:23.980 --> 02:27.030
Huh? What could this be?

02:27.030 --> 02:28.800
Kid Biscuits?

02:28.800 --> 02:31.170
A special trial offer?

02:31.170 --> 02:34.640
Biscuits for kids? Isn't that one sparkling~

02:33.890 --> 02:34.630
Huh?

02:34.630 --> 02:36.630
Let me see that!

02:34.640 --> 02:36.630
They've included an instruction leaflet.

02:36.630 --> 02:39.100
This and that... er...

02:39.100 --> 02:41.330
Hey, this looks so good~

02:40.340 --> 02:41.660
No!!!

02:41.330 --> 02:44.150
I'm digging in~

02:41.660 --> 02:42.380
You can't eat that!

02:42.380 --> 02:44.150
That's not an ordinary snack!

02:44.150 --> 02:45.100
Huh?

02:45.100 --> 02:47.510
If you eat it carelessly, you'll get in trouble!

02:47.510 --> 02:48.560
Pepo!

02:49.870 --> 02:51.250
What's this?

02:51.810 --> 02:54.290
Isn't this today's newspaper?!

02:54.860 --> 02:57.530
You must not do that! Please give it back!

02:58.040 --> 03:01.130
Oh no! Ruu-chama! Please wait!

03:01.130 --> 03:03.880
Ruu! Don't fly off!

03:04.570 --> 03:06.350
We're home~!

03:06.350 --> 03:08.610
Ah... I'm starving~

03:09.260 --> 03:12.290
Me, too. It's like I never feel full anymore lately~

03:12.290 --> 03:15.290
Oh, biscuits? Lucky!

03:15.290 --> 03:16.790
Ah! Gimme one too!

03:17.760 --> 03:19.930
Yummy~!

03:19.930 --> 03:21.870
You sneaky...

03:30.220 --> 03:31.870
AAAAAAAAH!!!

03:31.870 --> 03:34.250
W-w-why?!

03:34.440 --> 03:39.400
Miyu and Kanata the Kid

03:39.400 --> 03:43.160
What?! You ate the Kid Biscuit?

03:43.440 --> 03:45.260
Kid Biscuit~?

03:45.260 --> 03:46.740
Huh? What's that?

03:47.110 --> 03:49.200
It's a new product I got by mail order.

03:49.560 --> 03:52.420
It says that whoever eats it
immediately turns into a child.

03:52.420 --> 03:53.340
Papa!

03:53.340 --> 03:56.980
It's designed to help parents
understand their children better.

03:56.980 --> 03:59.240
Why did you order such a thing?

03:59.240 --> 04:00.520
Pepo!

03:59.630 --> 04:01.630
It was a trial offer!

04:02.420 --> 04:05.090
Hurry up and turn me back to my original self.

04:05.090 --> 04:06.260
Ah, yes!

04:06.260 --> 04:08.090
I'll get the instruction leaflet...?

04:06.260 --> 04:07.610
Pe-Pepo!

04:08.090 --> 04:10.010
No, Pepo!

04:10.320 --> 04:11.530
Pepo!

04:14.550 --> 04:15.600
AAH!!!

04:15.600 --> 04:17.400
Isn't that the instructions leaflet?!

04:17.400 --> 04:18.270
WHAT?!

04:18.270 --> 04:19.870
The instructions leaflet...

04:19.870 --> 04:21.650
Is it for the Kid Biscuit?

04:21.990 --> 04:26.680
“Also launching, Grown-Up Biscuits to turn one back to original self”...

04:25.450 --> 04:26.720
Grown Up Biscuit?

04:26.680 --> 04:27.860
That should work if I eat it.

04:27.860 --> 04:29.440
I-I'll search for it right away!

04:29.440 --> 04:32.430
Here? No... Here? No... Where... Where...

04:32.430 --> 04:34.960
This is bad! It's not here...

04:34.960 --> 04:36.490
So that means...

04:36.490 --> 04:39.680
Kanata-oniitan will remain a child?

04:42.130 --> 04:44.380
Mail order is too terrible...

04:46.790 --> 04:49.310
I've placed an order for Grown-Up Biscuits.

04:49.670 --> 04:53.920
But we don't know when
that will reach them at all...

04:53.920 --> 04:55.140
Don’t worry!

04:55.140 --> 04:59.070
When they deliver the fastest, it's always a two-day period when it arrives!

04:59.070 --> 05:00.880
And the times they didn't deliver,

05:00.880 --> 05:05.180
I'd wait forever and ever and <i>ever</i> until I got tired of waiting, and it still wouldn't come...

05:05.180 --> 05:06.320
Wannya!

05:06.320 --> 05:09.760
Wannya generally throws away such dangerous stuff.

05:09.760 --> 05:11.010
B-but Kanata,

05:11.010 --> 05:14.820
we'll do what we did before when I'd turned into mini-me size.

05:14.820 --> 05:19.000
You don't need to pretend to be a robot or a doll if someone sees you, so it's fine...

05:19.300 --> 05:20.500
That's right.

05:20.500 --> 05:22.760
Pretending to be a robot is painful.

05:22.760 --> 05:24.270
Yeah, painful...

05:24.270 --> 05:25.880
That doesn't comfort me at all!

05:25.880 --> 05:26.760
After all?!

05:27.100 --> 05:29.460
Darn it! Don't think of it as someone else's problem!

05:29.460 --> 05:30.240
Kanata...

05:30.240 --> 05:30.680
Huh?

05:32.180 --> 05:34.030
W-what is it?

05:34.770 --> 05:36.320
Kanata...

05:36.320 --> 05:39.530
Kanata, even though you're a kid, you're so cute!!!

05:39.530 --> 05:42.320
True! You look very lovely~

05:42.730 --> 05:43.690
Back off!

05:44.810 --> 05:46.390
Oh no! It's getting late!

05:46.390 --> 05:47.820
I won't be on time for my appointment!

05:47.820 --> 05:50.180
Late? Kanata~!

05:50.180 --> 05:51.780
Miyu-san, what appointment?

05:51.780 --> 05:54.750
He's promised to go and see a movie with Santa-kun and the others.

05:54.750 --> 05:57.580
What?! Wouldn't it be better if he didn't go?

05:57.580 --> 05:58.240
I'm going.

05:58.240 --> 06:00.970
If I don't see that movie today, I won't get another chance to see it anymore.

06:00.970 --> 06:03.410
But, looking like that...

06:03.410 --> 06:04.460
I'm going!

06:07.250 --> 06:09.890
Er... This is Kanata's cousin...

06:09.890 --> 06:12.140
Er... Haruka-kun!

06:12.140 --> 06:13.880
He's in third grade.

06:13.880 --> 06:17.250
I'm staying at Saionji's for the time being.

06:17.250 --> 06:18.200
Pleased to meet you!

06:18.200 --> 06:21.900
Huh? Somehow, he looks amazingly similar to Saionji-kun.

06:21.900 --> 06:22.860
Y-you think so?

06:23.180 --> 06:23.780
Yeah!

06:23.780 --> 06:27.220
Even though you're also his cousin,
Miyu-chan, you don't look like him at all.

06:27.220 --> 06:29.270
I wonder about that...

06:28.410 --> 06:29.390
Hmm...

06:29.270 --> 06:30.600
Rather than saying he resembles Kanata,

06:30.600 --> 06:34.010
I feel as if I'm looking at a grade-schooler Kanata.

06:34.010 --> 06:36.030
Everyone says so!

06:37.190 --> 06:38.770
Excuse me...

06:38.770 --> 06:41.430
Um... where is Kanata-kun?

06:41.430 --> 06:43.400
Ah! Er... he's just...

06:43.400 --> 06:44.840
He had to go out on an urgent business.

06:44.840 --> 06:45.790
WHAT?!

06:45.790 --> 06:46.890
That can't be!

06:46.890 --> 06:48.820
That's too bad...

06:48.820 --> 06:55.260
I was looking forward to spending a fun afternoon with Kanata-kun...

06:55.260 --> 06:56.310
It can't be helped.

06:56.610 --> 06:57.850
THAT'S RIGHT!

06:57.850 --> 07:01.820
If I treat Kanata-kun's cousin, Haruka-kun nicely...

07:02.510 --> 07:06.280
<i>Hanakomachi, I'm happy you treated my cousin nicely!</i>

07:06.280 --> 07:07.720
<i>Oh, Kanata-kun...</i>

07:07.720 --> 07:09.740
It was nothing.

07:09.740 --> 07:11.750
<i>You're too modest, Hanakomachi.</i>

07:11.750 --> 07:14.660
<i>Treat me too with some of that kindness!</i>

07:14.660 --> 07:16.380
And then, the two of us will...

07:16.380 --> 07:21.250
...leave Miyu-chan behind and make straight for high-school romance!!!

07:27.730 --> 07:29.130
Let's get it on!

07:29.130 --> 07:31.340
Hello, Haruka-kun...

07:33.720 --> 07:37.160
What should I do? When I look at him, my heart beats so fast...

07:41.940 --> 07:43.620
Chris-san's weird...

07:43.620 --> 07:45.060
She's always weird, though...

07:45.060 --> 07:48.250
All the same, you easily notice, Chris-chan...

07:48.250 --> 07:49.030
Yeah...

07:50.300 --> 07:53.490
Hi~! Beautiful ladies!

07:53.490 --> 07:57.420
I offer beautiful roses to the beautiful you!

07:57.420 --> 07:59.890
I heard it's totally different in the
commercials since it doesn't move much.

07:59.890 --> 08:01.870
I'm totally looking forward to it!

08:01.870 --> 08:02.390
Huh?

08:02.390 --> 08:07.740
Isn't that Miyu-chan along with some splendid ladies and some not-so-important boys?

08:07.740 --> 08:10.970
Alright! They'll be watching the movie with me!

08:10.970 --> 08:12.710
Hi, lady~

08:12.710 --> 08:15.320
A ticket for a middle-schooler, and one for a cockatiel.

08:15.320 --> 08:18.020
And then for the beautiful you, a passionate red rose...

08:18.020 --> 08:19.890
We don't sell tickets for cockatiels.

08:19.890 --> 08:21.150
No!

08:20.720 --> 08:25.850
Very enjoyable

08:21.150 --> 08:23.680
There's no help for it, Okame-chan. Let's give up.

08:21.930 --> 08:24.720
IRATE ANGEL’S
SECRET RIDDLE

08:26.310 --> 08:27.900
END OF MOVIE

08:28.710 --> 08:30.650
It was so good~

08:30.650 --> 08:31.820
Yeah, yeah!

08:31.820 --> 08:35.510
When the irate angel is around, and the falling angel wasn't there,

08:35.510 --> 08:39.870
and the scene where the angel decided to live as an irate angel makes you want to cry, doesn't it?!

08:40.260 --> 08:41.630
Right, right!

08:49.630 --> 08:51.650
Chris-chan... again...

08:52.800 --> 08:53.820
Let's see...

08:53.820 --> 08:55.720
Ah! I guess this one goes here?

08:55.720 --> 08:58.650
Maybe other than the Grown-Up Biscuits,

08:58.650 --> 09:02.280
there's a way for Kanata-san to return to his original self, don't you think?

09:02.280 --> 09:04.620
It'll be good if that's true, Wannya.

09:04.620 --> 09:06.150
Pepo...

09:06.470 --> 09:08.320
Thank you!

09:08.320 --> 09:09.430
Papa...

09:09.790 --> 09:11.070
Pepo...

09:11.070 --> 09:13.150
It's okay, you two.

09:13.150 --> 09:16.230
But you must not carelessly tear paper again.

09:16.230 --> 09:17.260
Pa-Pepo.

09:17.260 --> 09:20.870
Hey Wannya, did you find anything new?

09:20.870 --> 09:23.300
Right. Er...

09:23.300 --> 09:29.740
There have been rare cases of customers who made use of Kid Biscuits more than what was recommended for their bodies.

09:30.460 --> 09:32.650
Excessive use...?

09:32.650 --> 09:34.840
I guess it means it was used a lot.

09:34.840 --> 09:38.390
But, ‘rare’ means such cases were not very common.

09:38.650 --> 09:40.810
Is Kanata-oniitan going to be alright?

09:41.650 --> 09:43.570
Perhaps...?

09:44.030 --> 09:45.200
Wannya...

09:45.200 --> 09:47.560
H-he's going to be fine, I think!

09:51.180 --> 09:54.620
I'm getting excited all over again with this art book!

09:54.620 --> 09:57.310
Ooh! I wonder if I should also buy one.

09:57.310 --> 09:59.580
Hey, Santa! It looks interesting!

09:59.580 --> 10:01.570
What's with you? Calling me ‘Santa’...

10:01.570 --> 10:03.800
Call me Santa-oniisan.

10:03.800 --> 10:08.060
Besides, this may look interesting,
but wouldn't it be too difficult for you?

10:08.060 --> 10:08.770
Hey!

10:08.770 --> 10:09.920
There, there!

10:09.920 --> 10:11.710
It's totally frustrating...

10:11.710 --> 10:12.900
Just a bit more...

10:12.900 --> 10:13.670
Oh...

10:13.670 --> 10:14.460
This one?

10:14.460 --> 10:15.330
Yeah...

10:15.330 --> 10:16.270
Here you go.

10:16.270 --> 10:20.210
Haruka-kun, you too will grow as tall as me.

10:20.210 --> 10:23.120
But isn't that book too difficult for you?

10:23.120 --> 10:24.850
Look, look! How about this one?

10:24.850 --> 10:25.470
Okay?

10:25.470 --> 10:26.650
Oh, that's a good one!

10:26.650 --> 10:28.980
I read this book, too, when I was younger.

10:28.980 --> 10:30.290
What? You too, Nanami-chan?!

10:30.290 --> 10:31.780
Yeah! It was so exciting...

10:31.780 --> 10:33.390
I know, right!

10:33.390 --> 10:35.150
I don't need a book like that!

10:35.150 --> 10:38.200
He seems somewhat upset...

10:40.720 --> 10:42.270
So frustrating!

10:42.270 --> 10:43.720
It can't be helped.

10:43.720 --> 10:46.480
They all think you're a third grader.

10:46.480 --> 10:50.160
But, just because I'm a kid, they don't have to be so condescending...

11:01.710 --> 11:03.680
AAAAAAAAAAAAAAH!!!

11:03.680 --> 11:04.570
Miyu?

11:04.570 --> 11:05.590
Haruka-kun?

11:05.590 --> 11:06.640
What's the matter?

11:06.640 --> 11:09.950
U-um... It's nothing!

11:09.950 --> 11:12.560
I-I'm going to the washroom for a bit!

11:13.600 --> 11:16.070
The storekeeper says to keep your voices down!

11:16.070 --> 11:19.050
What happened to me?

11:19.050 --> 11:21.090
I can't speak very well...

11:21.550 --> 11:23.900
Everyone's definitely going to get suspicious...

11:23.900 --> 11:26.000
...if they find out that the third grader kid Haruka-kun has vanished,

11:26.000 --> 11:28.310
and there's a kindergartener kid in his place.

11:28.310 --> 11:30.390
Anyway, shall we go home together?

11:30.390 --> 11:31.830
I'll go home on my own!

11:31.830 --> 11:33.630
But the Kid Biscuit...

11:33.630 --> 11:36.080
We don't know what will happen next...

11:36.080 --> 11:38.210
It's risky to be on your own...

11:38.510 --> 11:41.530
Well, I'll go tell everyone we're leaving first.

11:41.530 --> 11:42.550
Stay here.

11:42.550 --> 11:43.680
I know!

11:44.000 --> 11:46.560
I'm not a kid, after all!

11:47.780 --> 11:50.050
But no matter how I look at it, I'm just a kid...

11:50.050 --> 11:52.390
Well! Are you on your own, kid?

11:53.430 --> 11:57.140
Kid... Where's the rest of your family?

11:57.140 --> 12:00.380
Ah... well... my family...

12:01.610 --> 12:03.140
You're lost, aren't you?

12:04.010 --> 12:05.200
Don't worry!

12:05.200 --> 12:09.290
Big sister here will help look for your family members~

12:08.520 --> 12:09.540
No! I...

12:10.740 --> 12:11.810
Hey!

12:12.470 --> 12:14.540
SOMEONE HELP ME!!!

12:24.030 --> 12:25.480
How strange...

12:25.480 --> 12:27.840
Where could those two have gone?

12:27.840 --> 12:29.970
I'm right here! Sorry, sorry!

12:29.970 --> 12:30.860
What's up?

12:30.860 --> 12:32.560
Huh? Where is Haruka-kun?

12:32.890 --> 12:34.120
Er, about that...

12:34.120 --> 12:37.670
He suddenly said he wants to go home...

12:38.180 --> 12:41.450
He may be a cheeky brat, but he's still a kid, after all!

12:41.450 --> 12:42.990
<i>If Kanata heard that, he'd get mad...</i>

12:42.990 --> 12:44.210
Well, I guess it can't be helped.

12:44.210 --> 12:45.620
Too bad, though.

12:45.620 --> 12:48.880
Th-that's why I'll be taking him home now...

12:48.880 --> 12:50.500
Well, see you!

12:51.660 --> 12:53.960
He's such a kid!

12:54.490 --> 12:58.300
You're as much of a kid, Kurosu-kun, being so childishly persistent...

12:58.640 --> 13:00.840
Sorry to keep you waiting, Kanata...

13:00.840 --> 13:03.520
Huh? Kanata? Where...?

13:03.850 --> 13:04.760
Why?

13:04.760 --> 13:06.090
LOST CHILD
CENTER

13:08.660 --> 13:12.510
Um... I... I'm fine by myself, so...

13:12.990 --> 13:14.910
So cute~!

13:15.220 --> 13:17.240
Here, take this!

13:17.650 --> 13:19.570
SO CUTE!!!

13:20.610 --> 13:23.150
It's okay even if you don't say your name.

13:23.150 --> 13:25.900
We're going to call for your family member now~

13:25.900 --> 13:26.500
What?!

13:26.210 --> 13:27.610
LOST CHILD
CENTER

13:31.160 --> 13:34.520
Dear customers, this is an announcement of a lost child.

13:34.970 --> 13:40.900
A boy, around 3 years old, dressed in blue trousers has been found.

13:36.700 --> 13:37.620
Kanata?

13:40.900 --> 13:43.150
Whoever is in charge of this child...

13:43.150 --> 13:45.840
...may please come to the Lost Child Center.

13:46.990 --> 13:49.720
There! Someone will soon be here for you.

13:48.800 --> 13:49.810
No!

13:49.720 --> 13:51.240
Ah, kid!

13:52.890 --> 13:54.480
Wait!!!

13:54.540 --> 13:55.460
Oh...

13:55.460 --> 13:57.340
He ran away!

13:57.800 --> 13:59.350
Miyu! Miyu?

14:01.100 --> 14:02.820
Oh... Miyu...

14:02.820 --> 14:05.320
What?! He ran away?!

14:05.610 --> 14:07.070
I'm sorry...

14:07.070 --> 14:09.040
Is he your younger brother?

14:09.040 --> 14:11.280
Well, it's something like that...

14:11.950 --> 14:12.900
Ah...

14:14.010 --> 14:17.520
Well, I guess I have to go home on my own...

14:18.500 --> 14:21.930
I wonder if Kanata has gone home on his own...

14:21.930 --> 14:24.880
That's right! I'll ask Wannya to search for him as well.

14:28.760 --> 14:31.850
I'm definitely not going to miss the Tofu Time Service!

14:34.470 --> 14:36.680
He's not answering at all.

14:36.680 --> 14:39.190
In any case, I have to look for Kanata!

14:49.880 --> 14:51.570
Kanata!!!

14:53.480 --> 14:54.620
Ah!!!

15:01.950 --> 15:03.720
Kanata!!!

15:07.730 --> 15:09.640
So frustrating...

15:09.640 --> 15:11.500
Hey kid, what are you doing on your own?

15:11.500 --> 15:13.140
Oh... Ah!

15:13.760 --> 15:15.430
Where's your family?

15:15.430 --> 15:16.610
Ah! Er...

15:16.610 --> 15:17.200
You-

15:17.200 --> 15:20.440
Ah! There's my mom! Mama!!!

15:21.430 --> 15:23.110
That was close...

15:25.620 --> 15:28.090
Kanata... are you alright?

15:28.510 --> 15:30.230
Surely you haven't gotten into a car accident...

15:30.230 --> 15:32.740
Or perhaps, been kidnapped by weirdos?

15:32.740 --> 15:36.880
No, that won't happen.
You're a middle schooler, after all.

15:37.950 --> 15:39.710
KANATA!!!

15:42.860 --> 15:45.170
Finally I can see Saionji.

15:45.460 --> 15:46.770
It's so far away~

15:46.770 --> 15:50.950
Is she back yet? Ah, so troublesome...

15:51.470 --> 15:51.880
Ah...

15:55.240 --> 15:58.570
Has this road always been this wide?

16:03.320 --> 16:06.400
It looks like a totally different scene from usual...

16:11.080 --> 16:18.210
This is how it must have looked like to Momoko-chan as always.

16:19.390 --> 16:21.780
Alright! Anyway, let's go home!

16:30.840 --> 16:35.170
It's Time Service once again. The tofu's on sale!!!

16:35.170 --> 16:37.370
Yes, yes, yes! I'll buy!

16:40.350 --> 16:43.420
It looks like a serious battle out there...

16:43.420 --> 16:48.250
But Wannya's taking a break while Kanata-oniitan's in trouble...

16:48.250 --> 16:49.220
Tofu!

16:49.380 --> 16:51.210
Tofu...

16:51.210 --> 16:53.510
Hey Wannya, hurry up and come here!

16:53.510 --> 16:54.750
Papa!

16:56.280 --> 16:59.380
Kanata... oniitan?

17:02.850 --> 17:04.210
Papa!

17:04.460 --> 17:05.850
Oniitan!

17:05.850 --> 17:06.920
Pepo-pa!

17:10.130 --> 17:14.930
Kanata-oniitan, you're going to be fine. Wannya is here.

17:20.180 --> 17:22.050
Help!

17:23.310 --> 17:26.710
Grr... It's the usual crow!

17:27.330 --> 17:29.730
I'll be your opponent!

17:41.020 --> 17:42.040
Oniitan!

17:42.040 --> 17:43.040
Papa!

17:49.500 --> 17:53.870
What d'you think you're doing, you crow!

18:03.200 --> 18:05.720
Miyu-san, the reinforcement is here!

18:05.720 --> 18:07.980
Huh? The crow's gone.

18:10.470 --> 18:11.650
Papa...

18:14.820 --> 18:15.750
Kanata!

18:15.750 --> 18:16.400
Ruu!

18:18.120 --> 18:19.810
Don't cry...

18:19.810 --> 18:22.100
Ruu-chama, look at my tongue!

18:22.100 --> 18:24.910
I'm licking... Lick, lick!

18:25.880 --> 18:27.060
Kanata...

18:49.760 --> 18:51.160
Kanata...

18:52.940 --> 18:54.020
Let’s hurry up!

18:54.020 --> 18:58.320
There just might be some instructions on how to stop this before it gets even worse...

19:07.450 --> 19:10.570
Kanata, you're going to be fine.

19:10.570 --> 19:15.240
Any moment now, the doorbell's going to ring,

19:15.240 --> 19:18.240
and the Grown-Up Biscuits will arrive.

19:18.900 --> 19:21.640
Okay? Don't worry.

19:32.570 --> 19:33.610
<i>Kanata...</i>

19:35.060 --> 19:38.590
<i>Suppose you're unable to return to your real self...</i>

20:12.970 --> 20:15.530
Kanata, everything's going to be fine.

20:15.530 --> 20:18.730
It's surely... surely going to be fine.

20:20.440 --> 20:22.750
But... but...

20:23.230 --> 20:26.590
If... really if...

20:26.930 --> 20:27.970
you're unable...

20:29.120 --> 20:30.720
to return to your real self...

20:31.610 --> 20:33.710
I'll look after you.

20:35.680 --> 20:37.660
It's going to be alright...

20:37.660 --> 20:41.020
It'll take 14 years, but you'll return...

20:41.020 --> 20:42.250
That's right!

20:42.590 --> 20:44.690
About 14 years...

20:45.000 --> 20:46.700
It's just a blink of time.

20:55.990 --> 20:57.100
Kanata...

20:58.290 --> 20:59.320
Kanata...

21:00.940 --> 21:02.450
KANATA!

21:36.520 --> 21:38.970
Ka... nata...

21:39.450 --> 21:40.620
Miyu...

21:41.120 --> 21:42.220
I can speak again...

21:42.220 --> 21:43.220
Kanata!!!

21:43.220 --> 21:45.450
Kanata, Kanata, Kanata!!!

21:45.450 --> 21:47.260
You're back...

21:47.260 --> 21:50.100
You're back to your original self...

21:50.100 --> 21:51.140
Miyu?

21:51.610 --> 21:54.910
I'm so glad! So glad!

21:55.640 --> 21:56.640
Miyu...

21:57.580 --> 22:00.090
I'm so glad... so glad-

22:02.550 --> 22:03.130
Huh?

22:03.960 --> 22:05.970
AAAH! AAAH!

22:05.970 --> 22:07.220
What do you think you're doing?!

22:10.810 --> 22:12.230
Ouch...

22:12.230 --> 22:14.450
Seriously... You're unbelievable!

22:13.840 --> 22:15.270
W-what was that for?

22:22.060 --> 22:23.340
Well, whatever.

22:24.360 --> 22:26.280
I'm really glad.

22:27.110 --> 22:30.070
Yeah...
Thanks, Miyu.

22:33.870 --> 22:36.960
Yay! I got it!

22:37.220 --> 22:40.990
The effect of a Kid Biscuit lasts for only half a day!

22:40.990 --> 22:43.480
Even if the Grown-Up Biscuit doesn't get here on time-

22:42.650 --> 22:44.080
Papa!

22:44.460 --> 22:45.480
Ruu!

22:45.480 --> 22:46.840
Papa!

22:46.990 --> 22:50.280
Huh... Huh? Huh?!

22:50.670 --> 22:53.640
You were too late, Wannya.

22:55.070 --> 22:57.760
Kanata-san, I'm so glad!

22:59.320 --> 23:01.400
<i>Wannya's childcare journal:</i>

23:01.400 --> 23:05.350
<i>Thank goodness Kanata-san has returned to his original self.</i>

23:05.350 --> 23:09.850
<i>However, the Kid Biscuit was an extremely dangerous product.</i>

23:06.510 --> 23:12.250
RETURNED
GOODS

23:06.510 --> 23:12.250
Do not eat!

23:09.850 --> 23:17.020
<i>I think I'll inform the mail order place never to send me samples of new products anymore.</i>

23:20.050 --> 23:24.870
Motto tanoshii koto ga

23:20.050 --> 23:24.870
I felt that everyday

23:25.510 --> 23:28.500
afureru mainichi

23:25.510 --> 23:28.500
more fun-filled days

23:29.300 --> 23:33.510
matteru kigashita

23:29.300 --> 23:33.510
were waiting ahead

23:35.430 --> 23:43.000
datte kimi to mata aeta kara

23:35.430 --> 23:43.000
because I was able to meet you again

23:43.090 --> 23:48.820
Nee ima wa aserazu

23:43.090 --> 23:48.820
Hey, don't be in rush now

23:50.010 --> 23:53.370
Yukkuri aruite

23:50.010 --> 23:53.370
Walk slowly

23:53.670 --> 23:57.160
Takusan waratte

23:53.670 --> 23:57.160
Laugh a lot

23:57.420 --> 24:01.500
Soshite nanika wo mitsuketara

23:57.420 --> 24:01.500
And when you find something

24:01.710 --> 24:05.080
daiji ni shiyou

24:01.710 --> 24:05.080
let's cherish it

24:05.550 --> 24:08.750
mata aeta ne

24:05.550 --> 24:08.750
until we meet again

24:09.300 --> 24:14.790
Issho ni iyou

24:09.300 --> 24:14.790
Let's stay together

24:22.520 --> 24:29.900
The End

24:30.050 --> 24:59.960
Next Episode

24:32.210 --> 24:33.860
Winter sure is cold!

24:34.210 --> 24:36.500
As expected, I also can't take it. Brr...

24:36.500 --> 24:37.810
AAH! What is this?!

24:37.810 --> 24:39.540
Whoa! It's full of weird stuff!

24:39.540 --> 24:42.750
AAH! Miyu-san, Kanata-san! What happened to you?

24:42.750 --> 24:44.330
Next on Daa! Daa! Daa!:

24:44.330 --> 24:45.290
Farewell, Waru Waru Gang

24:45.670 --> 24:48.350
I see... This catastrophe's Waru Waru Gang's fault, I see...

24:48.350 --> 24:49.090
Really, ugh...

24:49.090 --> 24:50.930
Even fascination has a limit, huh?

24:50.930 --> 24:52.110
Pe-Pepo!

24:52.980 --> 24:54.030
That's Waru Gang for you.

24:54.030 --> 24:54.840
Huh? Farewell?

24:54.840 --> 24:56.600
To whom are we saying farewell?
